[1] download and install cath-tools-genomescan-master.zip 
[2] Copy "evaluate_sequence.fasta" and "test_sequence.fasta" in ./cath-tools-genomescan-master/data/
[3] Run genomescan:
    (a) cd ./cath-tools-genomescan-master/
    (b) ./apps/cath-genomescan.pl -i data/evaluate_sequence.fasta -l data/funfam-hmm3-v4_2_0.lib -o evaluate_results/
    (c) ./apps/cath-genomescan.pl -i data/test_sequence.fasta -l data/funfam-hmm3-v4_2_0.lib -o test_results/
[4] Extract family and map file:
    (a) python Extract_family_name.py ./evaluate_results/evaluate_sequence.crh ./evaluate_results/evaluate_sequence.family ./evaluate_results/evaluate_sequence.map
    (b) python Extract_family_name.py ./test_results/test_sequence.crh ./test_results/test_sequence.family ./test_results/test_sequence.map
[5] Download GO terms for templates 
    (a) python Create_GO_for_templates.py ./ evaluate 20
    (b) python Create_GO_for_templates.py ./ test 20
[6] GO prediction
    python Create_Prediction_result.py ./workdir
    workdir includes MF/BP/CC_gene_list
